  <h3>Data Limitations</h3>
  <div class="callout warning">
    <strong>1. Missing 2020 data.</strong> The source dataset contains no entries for 2020. This represents a gap in the 11-year timeline and means any trend line across 2019–2021 is based on the two flanking years only. The true 2020 pattern — whether it continued the Expansion phase format or anticipated the Consolidation phase — is unknown from this dataset.
  </div>
  <div class="callout warning">
